  "body": "Some specs are directly calling structuredSerialize and again immediately structuredDeserialize to achieve the same, per webref: https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Aw3c%2Fwebref+structuredDeserialize+path%3A%2F%5Eed%5C%2F%2F+path%3A%2F%5Eed%5C%2Flinks%5C%2F%2F&type=code\r\n\r\n* [User Timing](https://w3c.github.io/user-timing/#the-performancemark-constructor) to copy PaymentMarkOptions.detail\r\n* [Streams](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#abstract-opdef-structuredclone) to copy chunks\r\n* [Payment Handler](https://w3c.github.io/payment-handler/#respond-to-paymentrequest-algorithm) to copy [PaymentHandlerResponse](https://w3c.github.io/payment-handler/#dom-paymenthandlerresponse)\r\n* [WebRTC Encoded Transform](https://w3c.github.io/webrtc-encoded-transform/#abstract-opdef-writeencodeddata) to copy frames\r\n* [WebCodecs](https://w3c.github.io/webcodecs/#videoframe-copy-videoframe-metadata) to copy metadata\r\n\r\nMaybe worth exporting some helper?\r\n\r\n(From https://github.com/whatwg/streams/issues/1285)",
